---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base description="Unicore Lubricants blends oils and specialty greases in controlled batches for Indian road corridors, farm fields and factory floors."
  title="Unicore Lubricants — About" active="about" bodyClass="bg-page-bg text-body-text antialiased">

  <main id="main-content" class="pt-[116px]">

    <!-- BREADCRUMB -->
    <div class="border-b border-hairline bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-3 text-xs text-light-text flex items-center gap-2">
        <a href="index.html" data-path="home" class="hover:text-heading-black transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span class="">/</span>
        <span class="text-heading-black font-medium">About</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-16 pb-20">
      <div class="max-w-4xl text-left">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-logo-blue"></span>
          <span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-semibold text-logo-blue">ABOUT UNICORE</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-[54px] leading-[1.1] text-heading-black font-normal mb-6">
          Lubricants built for machinery running in hard Indian conditions.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-body-text leading-relaxed font-normal max-w-3xl">
          We manufacture engine oils, gear oils, coolants, and specialty greases for the vehicles, tractors, and factory lines that keep transport and trade moving every day.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- PHOTOGRAPH FRAME: THE PLANT -->
      <div class="mt-12 w-full border border-hairline bg-product-frame p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 flex items-center justify-center text-center min-h-[300px] sm:min-h-[380px]">
        <p class="text-[13px] italic text-light-text max-w-md leading-relaxed">
          [Photograph: Exterior view of the Unicore manufacturing plant and dispatch loading bay on light ground]
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- COMPANY STORY -->
    <section class="border-t border-hairline bg-white py-20">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
          
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 text-left">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-logo-blue"></span>
              <span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-semibold text-logo-blue">OUR WORK</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-heading-black font-normal leading-tight mb-6">
              Supplying dependable lubricants to counters and workshops.
            </h2>
            
            <!-- FACT CONFIRMATION TABLE / REEL -->
            <div class="border border-hairline bg-page-bg p-6 space-y-4">
              <div class="border-b border-hairline pb-3">
                <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-light-text font-semibold block">Manufacturing Location</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-heading-black font-medium mt-1 block">[to be confirmed by Unicore]</span>
              </div>
              <div class="border-b border-hairline pb-3">
                <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-light-text font-semibold block">Year Established</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-heading-black font-medium mt-1 block">[to be confirmed by Unicore]</span>
              </div>
              <div class="border-b border-hairline pb-3">
                <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-light-text font-semibold block">Operating Team</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-heading-black font-medium mt-1 block">[to be confirmed by Unicore]</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-light-text font-semibold block">Production Volume</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-heading-black font-medium mt-1 block">[to be confirmed by Unicore]</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="lg:col-span-7 text-left space-y-6 lg:pt-4">
            <p class="text-base text-body-text leading-relaxed">
              Unicore Lubricants manufactures dependable oils and specialty greases built directly for Indian road corridors, farm fields, and factory floors. Indian machinery operates under unforgiving conditions: intense summer ambient heat, pervasive road dust, continuous heavy loads, and long working cycles without sudden rest. Our products are made to shield rotating gears, protect sliding metal contacts, and hold steady fluid film so motors and hydraulic systems run reliably.
            </p>
            <p class="text-base text-body-text leading-relaxed">
              We make our products for regional stockists, counter owners, mechanic workshops, commercial transport fleets, and industrial plant maintenance buyers. Instead of complex claims, we focus on steady batch quality, durable containers, clear markings, and dependable dispatches so our stockists always receive containers ready for trade.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HOW WE MAKE IT (3 STEPS) -->
    <section class="border-t border-hairline bg-page-bg py-20">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12 text-left">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-logo-blue"></span>
            <span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-semibold text-logo-blue">PROCESS</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-heading-black font-normal mb-3">
            How we make it
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-body-text leading-relaxed">
            Every product batch moves through three straightforward stages from base fluids to finished sealed packs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          
          <!-- STEP 1: BLENDING -->
          <div class="border border-hairline bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 text-left flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="w-full aspect-[4/3] border border-hairline bg-product-frame mb-6 p-4 flex items-center justify-center text-center">
                <span class="text-[13px] italic text-light-text leading-relaxed">
                  [Photograph: Inside blending area with temperature-controlled mixing kettles on light ground]
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-logo-blue font-normal mb-2">01</div>
              <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-heading-black font-normal mb-3">Controlled blending</h3>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-body-text leading-relaxed">
                Base fluids and performance agents are combined in measured batches with continuous mechanical mixing and uniform heating to ensure even fluid body across every drum.
              </p>
            </div>
            
          </div>

          <!-- STEP 2: CHECKING -->
          <div class="border border-hairline bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 text-left flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="w-full aspect-[4/3] border border-hairline bg-product-frame mb-6 p-4 flex items-center justify-center text-center">
                <span class="text-[13px] italic text-light-text leading-relaxed">
                  [Photograph: Physical batch sample verification showing clarity and flow check]
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-logo-blue font-normal mb-2">02</div>
              <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-heading-black font-normal mb-3">Batch checking</h3>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-body-text leading-relaxed">
                Samples are drawn from each finished blend to confirm fluid weight, visual clarity, and steady flow before releasing the batch to the container fill station.
              </p>
            </div>
            
          </div>

          <!-- STEP 3: PACKING -->
          <div class="border border-hairline bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 text-left flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="w-full aspect-[4/3] border border-hairline bg-product-frame mb-6 p-4 flex items-center justify-center text-center">
                <span class="text-[13px] italic text-light-text leading-relaxed">
                  [Photograph: Container filling line, foil seal application, and cap fastening]
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-logo-blue font-normal mb-2">03</div>
              <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-heading-black font-normal mb-3">Tight packing &amp; sealing</h3>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-body-text leading-relaxed">
                Finished fluids and specialty greases are filled into clean retail bottles, trade buckets, and heavy barrels with tamper-evident seals to protect stock during road transit.
              </p>
            </div>
            
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOUR COMMITMENTS (PROMISES, NOT CERTIFICATIONS) -->
    <section class="border-t border-hairline bg-white py-20">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14 text-left">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-logo-blue"></span>
            <span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-semibold text-logo-blue">STANDARDS</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-heading-black font-normal mb-3">
            Our trade commitments
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-body-text leading-relaxed">
            Four practical promises we stand by for every distributor, dealer, and fleet buyer who stocks Unicore.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
          
          <div class="border border-hairline bg-page-bg p-6 sm:p-8 text-left">
            <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-logo-blue font-semibold block mb-2">PROMISE 01</span>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-heading-black font-normal mb-3">Steady batch quality</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-body-text leading-relaxed">
              Every drum, pail, and bottle has the same thickness, flow, and colour as the previous order. No thin refills or shifting grades.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-hairline bg-page-bg p-6 sm:p-8 text-left">
            <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-logo-blue font-semibold block mb-2">PROMISE 02</span>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-heading-black font-normal mb-3">Genuine fill &amp; seal</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-body-text leading-relaxed">Packs are filled and sealed so mechanics and workshops receive genuine factory fluids.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-hairline bg-page-bg p-6 sm:p-8 text-left">
            <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-logo-blue font-semibold block mb-2">PROMISE 03</span>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-heading-black font-normal mb-3">Direct trade contact</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-body-text leading-relaxed">
              When you call Unicore, you speak directly with people who manage batches, pricing, and regional consignments without middlemen.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-hairline bg-page-bg p-6 sm:p-8 text-left">
            <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-logo-blue font-semibold block mb-2">PROMISE 04</span>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-heading-black font-normal mb-3">Careful road dispatch</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-body-text leading-relaxed">Consignments are packed and prepared for long-distance road transport to reach your warehouse securely.</p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- PHOTOGRAPH: PACKED STOCK -->
        <div class="mt-12 border border-hairline bg-product-frame p-8 sm:p-12 flex items-center justify-center text-center min-h-[220px]">
          <p class="text-[13px] italic text-light-text max-w-md leading-relaxed">
            [Photograph: Packed stock ready for transport, showing palletized barrels and trade cartons on light ground]
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CLOSING SINGLE DEEP-NAVY BAND -->
    <section class="bg-deep-navy text-white py-16 sm:py-20 border-t border-hairline">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between gap-8 text-left">
          <div class="max-w-2xl">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white"></span>
              <span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-semibold text-white/80">DIRECT FACTORY CONTACT</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white font-normal mb-4">
              Speak with our trade desk about regional supply.
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/80 leading-relaxed font-normal">
              Whether you run a regional parts counter, manage a fleet workshop, or want to distribute Unicore products in an open territory, we are ready to discuss trade terms.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4">
            <a href="contact.html" data-path="contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white hover:bg-page-bg text-deep-navy px-8 py-3.5 rounded-[2px] text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors duration-150 border border-white">
              Contact trade desk →
            </a>
            <a href="dealership.html" data-path="dealership" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-transparent hover:bg-white/10 text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-[2px] text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors duration-150 border border-white/40">
              Apply for dealership
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

</Base>
